{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn your opponent bots into piles of ash with the <strong>Hellfire</strong> Bundle, a blazing bunch of weapons forged in the ninth circle of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These weapon skins bring the heat to any fight, draped in basalt rock with red-hot lava between the seams. In short, a DLC bundle that looks like you pulled it straight out of an active volcano. The skins are fully decked out with fiery muzzle flashes, scorching hellish sounds, and flammable designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This bundle includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deluxe Pistol &quot;Hellfire&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deluxe Shock Pistol &quot;Hellfire&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deluxe Burst Rifle &quot;Hellfire&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deluxe Shotgun &quot;Hellfire&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deluxe SMG &quot;Hellfire&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deluxe Rocket Launcher &quot;Hellfire&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deluxe Sniper &quot;Hellfire&quot; Weapon Skin</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This bundle contains add-on content in the form of in-game items, and requires the base free-to-play app Hyper Dash. (Sold Separately)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075010?t=1759906454","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4075010?t=1759906454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075010/ace3a960522c3b06bcda86d310ed7d6243e749e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759906454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075010/ace3a960522c3b06bcda86d310ed7d6243e749e8/capsule_